  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Corruption study Macedoni</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">korruptionsstudie Makedon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultupphandling av en korruption studie &#xF6;ver Makedonien y syfte att kartl&#xE4;gga korruptionens omfattning och former samt existerande anti-korruptions mekanismer i Makedonien. Studien ska ge information b&#xE5;de till revisionen av landsstrategin och ambassadens interna anti-korruptions handlingsplan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement of a consultancy study of the extension and forms of corruption and existing anti-corruption mechanisms in Macedonia to constitute an input both in the revision of the cooperation strategy and in the formulation of an anti-corruption action plan of the Embassy in Skopje.</narrative>
  </description>
